      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Given the fall and dizziness, it is safest to prioritize your well-being; please seek medical advice if the symptoms worsen or do not improve quickly. For minor dizziness, try sitting or lying down in a quiet, dim room to let your body stabilize. Taking short breaks away from bright screens and trying some slow, deep breathing exercises can sometimes help with lightheadedness and eye strain. If the feeling persists or becomes severe, please contact a healthcare professional.",
